{"type":"json_object","message":"The requested interval is the fiscal year ended December 27, 2008. The table gives the beginning-of-year balance at the start of that year (which equals the Dec. 29, 2007 ending balance) as $126.6 million and the ending balance at Dec. 27, 2008 as $214.4 million. I will compute the net change as ending balance minus beginning balance.","tool":"calculate","arguments":{"expression":"214.4 - 126.6","variables":{"ending_2008":{"value":214.4,"source":"source:t8c1n0","unit":"USD_million"},"beginning_2008":{"value":126.6,"source":"source:t1c1n0","unit":"USD_million"}},"sources":{"ending_2008":"source:t8c1n0","beginning_2008":"source:t1c1n0"}}}